OL,3,GNEWSA'Sense of shock' 10 years on from
OL,4,Ahotel city fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is 10 years since a devastating fire
OL,7,Fripped through an historic hotel in
OL,8,FDevon.
OL,10,FThe Royal Clarence Hotel fire in Exeter
OL,11,Fin 2016 remains one of the biggest
OL,12,Fincidents of its kind in the South
OL,13,FWest, lasting 10 days overall and
OL,14,Finvolving 95 fire crews over the course
OL,15,Fof the incident.
OL,17,FThe building, mainly put up in 1769,
OL,18,Fbut with older materials in it, is now
OL,19,Fbeing rebuilt and is set to be turned
OL,20,Finto apartments.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
