OL,3,GNEWSA'Sense of shock' 10 years on from
OL,4,Ahotel city fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt new owners said archaeological Roman
OL,7,Fremains found, including a skeleton
OL,8,Funderneath a well, were due to be
OL,9,Fpreserved.
